</head>
<body>
<header class="hero">
  <canvas id="coin-hero"></canvas>
</header>
<section class="about">
  <h2>About WastedToken Mint</h2>
  <p>Founded in 2024, WastedToken Mint forged a new standard in collectible challenge coins — where cryptographic culture meets old-world metallurgy. Each edition is struck in limited runs, serialized on-chain, and delivered as a tangible artifact you can hold, flip, and pass down. No two coins are alike; each bears the microscopic hash of its minting block. We don’t just mint tokens. We mint legacy.</p>
</section>
<section class="collection">
  <h2>Collectible Editions</h2>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="edition" data-edition="bronze" data-state="available">
      <canvas class="edition-canvas"></canvas>
      <button class="buy">Add to cart</button>
    </div>
